 "title": "Properties of the closed-subscheme system, [stacks-project]",
 "statement": "Every $X_\\alpha\\hookrightarrow Y$ is of finite presentation, all\ntransitions are closed immersions, and the canonical map\n$X\\to\\varprojlim_\\alpha X_\\alpha$ is an isomorphism.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-prop-nagata-sketch-fp-models/lemma-nagata-closed-subscheme-fp-system.md",
